[gd_scene load_steps=12 format=3 uid="uid://dp3w1world3d"]

; World3D — placeholder 3D cave for Milestone 4-3D.
;
; This is the 3D counterpart to World.tscn. It uses simple boxes and
; meshes (no MagicaVoxel assets yet, no VoxelTerrain plugin yet) to
; prove the 3D scene works end-to-end:
;
;   - WorldEnvironment provides ambient + fog (the dark cave mood)
;   - DirectionalLight3D is a moonlight key from above-behind
;   - Ground plane is a flat StaticBody3D + BoxMesh (10×10 m, dirt brown)
;   - Four wall boxes form a small cave room
;   - OmniLight3D campfire (orange, flickers via CampfireFlicker3D.gd)
;   - Player3D instance starts in the middle
;
; Once Zylann's Voxel Tools plugin is installed, the floor and walls
; will be replaced with a VoxelTerrain node. Once MagicaVoxel assets
; are made, the campfire box becomes a real campfire .glb.

